      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s013': 'Big Big Elephant',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s014':
          'Metal! Wood! Water! Fire! Earth! Guess which element I am. Get it right before you speak!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s016':
          '(Its footsteps are so loud… I should just make a guess.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s017': 'Little Fist Master',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s018':
          'I redirect force instead of meeting it head-on! You\'d better not try brute force either!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s020':
          '(It takes a stance… It feels like it could launch itself at any moment.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s021': 'Mech Dweller',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s022':
          'I built the bridges and fixed the machines. What can you do? Let\'s hear it.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s024':
          '(I can hear gears turning inside it… kind of cool.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s025': 'Bookworm Monster',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s026':
          'Shh—people are reading here! Did you wash your hands before coming in?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s028':
          '(It is glaring at me over a stack of books… I feel like I\'ve done something wrong.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s030':
          'Sniff… This flower came all the way from Japan. Have you been taking good care of it? Sniff…',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s032':
          '(Petals are falling onto my head… Is it about to cry?)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s034':
          'Sob, sob… Stay with me a little longer. Everyone leaves so quickly whenever they come…',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s036':
          '(It won\'t let go of my leg… This one is pretty clingy.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s037': 'Eco Baby',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s038':
          'Net zero by 2050! Are you sorting your waste? Answer me!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s040':
          '(Its stare is so serious… Now I suddenly feel guilty.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s041': 'Digital Doctor',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s042':
          'Quantum! Particles! Galaxies! Still with me? If not, it\'s okay—I\'ll slow down.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s044':
          '(It has already started writing equations in midair…)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s045': 'Friendly Bacterium',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s046':
          'Hello! I\'m related to something that lives inside your body. Don\'t worry—I\'m one of the good ones!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s048':
          '(It is smiling brightly… but I still take a step back.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s049': 'Fuzzy Spirit',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s050':
          'I\'ve walked this path for years. It\'s your first time here, right? I\'ll show you around!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s052':
          '(It has already started leading the way. Wait for me!)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s053': 'SM Beast',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s054':
          'Slides, numbers, meetings, more slides… Want to help me with some of it?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s056':
          '(The dark circles under its eyes are intense… I can feel the pressure.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s057': 'Sparkle Spirit',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s058':
          'New target detected! Analyzing… Hmm, barely passing. Interaction permitted.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s060':
          '(It is looking me over like a scanner… kind of unsettling.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s061': 'DNA Symphony',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s062':
          'Helix! Rising! Light and shadow! Intertwining! Did you understand my performance?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s064':
          '(It spins around several times… It seems to be enjoying itself.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s065': 'Wings',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s066':
          'When the wind blows, I turn. When it doesn\'t, I wait. Do you have that kind of patience?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s068':
          '(It stops moving after saying that… Is it waiting for the wind, or for me?)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s069': 'Cloudborne Thoughts',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s070':
          'Clouds never rush, and pinecones take their time to grow. Have you daydreamed today?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s072':
          '(It looks like it just woke up.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s073':
          'Sit and Listen: Pine Wind',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s074':
          'Shh… Listen. Can you hear the wind? No? Then be a little quieter.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s076':
          '(We stay silent like this for five seconds… It seems very satisfied.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s077': 'Why',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s078':
          'Why is the sky blue? Why does the wind move? Why did you come here today?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s080':
          '(The questions keep coming… Suddenly I don\'t know how to answer.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s081': 'Cloud Walker',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s082':
          'Hey, have you ever lain down and looked at this sky? If you don\'t lie down, you haven\'t really been here!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s084':
          '(It has already lain down… Fine, I\'ll try it too.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s085': 'Flow Within',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s086':
          'When the wind comes, I move a little. No hurry—you can\'t get away anyway.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.plot.s088':
          '(It speaks so calmly… but something feels a little off.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s001': 'You',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s002':
          'It looks like something left strange tracks here...',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s003':
          '(You crouch down for a closer look and discover unusual clues nearby.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s004':
          'These must be the tracks left by that spirit.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s005':
          '(You place the tracks you found into the trace collection jar.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s006':
          '(Keep searching for the next trace.)',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s007':
          'The spirit hurried past the Elephant Herd sculpture toward the Black Box. Something along the way seemed to radiate magic.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s008':
          'Still no trace? Try passing through the archway and see what you discover.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s009':
          'The spirit once stopped to admire the DNA sculpture for a long time before moving on. Try searching nearby.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s010':
          'This trace points toward the place in the photo. Search the area carefully.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s011':
          'The pinecone in the clouds seems to carry a spirit\'s unusual presence.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s012':
          'This trace points toward the place in the photo. Search the area carefully.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s013':
          'Stand at the heart of the question. When the screen disappears completely from view, look toward its reflection on the water and the answer will become clear.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s014':
          'Does one of the clouds in your field of view look different from the others?',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.monster.trace.plot.s015':
          'The spirit once gazed at the installation, waiting for the Chinese character “中,” representing National Central University, to appear.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s001': 'You found a magic stone.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s002':
          'Find the matching magic circle and place the stone on it!',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s003': 'You summoned a spirit.',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s004':
          'But it is staring at you aggressively...',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s005': 'Tap anywhere to continue',
      'widgets.game.catching.pages.plot.level.s006':
